WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.679
Every STEM role wants experience.

2
00:00:02.979 --> 00:00:10.177
But the six-figure roles, competitive internships, and fellowships you're aiming for all ask for that same experience.

3
00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.674
ScaleSTEM breaks that loop.

4
00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:18.275
Tell us where you're headed, and we build a computational research project around you.

5
00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:24.008
You learn exactly what it needs, lesson by lesson, with an advisor beside you the whole way.

6
00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:37.125
Then you build the model and publish your work in the ScaleStem Computational Research Journal, with your code and a résumé line aimed at the exact roles you want, so every application carries real signal.

7
00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:42.923
And then we put it to work. Hundreds of targeted applications, matched to your project.

8
00:00:43.223 --> 00:00:50.607
Introductions to professors, graduate students, and R&D scientists, from university labs to national labs.

9
00:00:50.957 --> 00:00:53.558
So you can step into the role you actually want.

10
00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:59.806
Your project starts with one questionnaire. Register for the next cohort at scalestem.com.
